---
description: AI/agent/RAG safety rules
globs: backend/ai/**/*.py, mcp-server/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---
- Facts come from retrieved chunks and the interaction table; the model only phrases them.
- The Advisory agent adds no new facts. The Verifier re-checks via MCP tools and labels verified/unverified/conflict.
- Run `ai/guardrails/output_checks.py` on every output; failures become "insufficient evidence".
- Redact PII before any cloud call; sensitive free text prefers local Ollama.
- Eval sets must be independent of the RAG/Verifier data; tune on `dev`, report once on `test`.
- Changing chunking/embeddings/prompts requires re-running the eval.
